        "ingredient/black-pepper"
      ],
      "text": "Pour in the {tomatoes} and the {stock}[herbs: , add the {herbs}] and bring to a simmer. Return the {sausages:plural} to the pan with the drained {beans:plural}. Cover and simmer gently, stirring now and then, until the sauce has thickened. Season with {salt} and {black-pepper}. Check the {sausages:plural} against a trusted guide to doneness.",
      "time": {"from": 25, "to": 30, "unit": "minute"},
